---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Terms of Service - DevToolsExport"
  description="Simple terms of service for DevToolsExport."
  canonical="https://devtoolsexport.com/terms/"
  showHeader={true}
>
  <main>
    <p class="eyebrow">Last updated: July 7, 2026</p>
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p>
      DevToolsExport is a free Chrome extension and share service for creating debugging snapshots. By using it, you agree to use it
      only for lawful debugging, support, and development workflows.
    </p>

    <h2>Share links</h2>
    <p>
      These share links are unlisted, but anyone with the link can view the debugging snapshot until it expires. Do not upload or
      share content that you do not have permission to share.
    </p>

    <h2>No sensitive submissions</h2>
    <p>
      The service applies redaction by default, but you are responsible for reviewing what you share, especially screenshots and page
      content that may contain confidential information.
    </p>

    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>
      DevToolsExport is provided as is without warranties. The service may change, pause, or stop operating at any time.
    </p>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
